<title>NEW ZEALAND: NZ Dec qtr PPI inputs, outputs both rise.</title>
<headline>NZ Dec qtr PPI inputs, outputs both rise.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Statistics New Zealand on Tuesday released the following data on the Producers Price Index for the December 1996 quarter (percentage change):</p>
<p>		  Dec 1996 qtr   Sept 1996 qtr    Dec 1995 qtr</p>
<p>Inputs index     +0.1		+0.2		 +0.1</p>
<p>Outputs index    +0.2		+0.4		 -0.1</p>
<p>		Yr-end Dec 1996  Yr-end Sept 1996  Yr-end Dec 1995</p>
<p>Inputs index     +0.4		 +0.4		  +0.5</p>
<p>Outputs index    +0.6		 +0.4		  +0.8</p>
<p>The PPI measures the average level of industrial input prices (excluding labour) and output prices.</p>
<p>-- Wellington newsroom (64 4) 473 4746</p>
</text>
